{"title":"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8d1f9b53a6cfea5ccba38122a414f326378d596.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq i \\leq 215$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"15\" /> let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/2/5b23811075c8df8d68f8bd77235302cc971c9b9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i = \\dfrac{1}{2^{i}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"56\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/2/262b7ba2cd5a078bdcc10db09e1a074a38488474.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{216} = \\dfrac{1}{2^{215}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"86\" height=\"37\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/d/54db465751421a0e30be4f85d30855b5a64d7c07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1, x_2, ..., x_{216}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"104\" height=\"11\" /> be positive real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/6853d134e86dc51163df6ea536d291a99045674c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i=1}^{216} x_i=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"77\" height=\"50\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/b/d7b9506952081a9ac8f31aad1fa511bd89797486.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{1 \\leq i &lt; j \\leq 216} x_ix_j = \\dfrac{107}{215} + \\sum_{i=1}^{216} \\dfrac{a_i x_i^{2}}{2(1-a_i)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"283\" height=\"53\" />. The maximum possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/065d6be75e4f9135b203ffd13a8e0b80deed3768.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2=\\dfrac{m}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"60\" height=\"33\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/f/f6fe5594e82684dcd2e54916280604daa6765f80.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\sum_{1 \\leq i &lt; j \\leq 216} x_ix_j &amp;= \\frac12\\left(\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^{216} x_i\\right)^2-\\sum_{i=1}^{216} x_i^2\\right)\\\\&amp;=\\frac12\\left(1-\\sum x_i^2\\right).\\end{align*}\" width=\"319\" height=\"107\" />\nSubstituting this into the second equation and collecting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a5be9b3f71a560e53186e8cfed279774c31dd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"19\" /> terms, we find \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/3/d4313463f68af4d0981c85ce35494272c0d286ea.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{i=1}^{216}\\frac{x_i^2}{1-a_i}=\\frac{1}{215}.\\]\" width=\"137\" height=\"50\" /> Conveniently, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/8/188243c0d99bcb7134871911d3054a4cb52b4fa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i=1}^{216} 1-a_i=215$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"126\" height=\"50\" /> so we find\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a4227127147ab66814e5f3ce3b4911a5f21b9cc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^{216} 1-a_i\\right)\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^{216}\\frac{x_i^2}{1-a_i}\\right)=1=\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^{216} x_i\\right)^2.\\]\" width=\"354\" height=\"57\" /> This is the equality case of the Cauchy-Schwarz Inequality, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/23481780a99f994acb0bbe32d3ab3716032e3ab9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i=c(1-a_i)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" /> for some constant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. Summing these equations and using the facts that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/6853d134e86dc51163df6ea536d291a99045674c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i=1}^{216} x_i=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"77\" height=\"50\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/8/188243c0d99bcb7134871911d3054a4cb52b4fa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i=1}^{216} 1-a_i=215$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"126\" height=\"50\" />, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/9/3092765324047dcbaefaad3add400ee6c68d5350.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\frac{1}{215}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"37\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/0/c303f4510508d2e201086199cbfca8404be25590.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2=c(1-a_2)=\\frac{1}{215}\\cdot \\left(1-\\frac{1}{4}\\right)=\\frac{3}{860}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"305\" height=\"43\" />. Hence the desired answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/5/dd56e79f0c7e9a21a9b966c6b92c7f9909f47d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$860+3=\\boxed{863}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Squaring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c89059dd01bbeabb6fbe372ee15fb032d4de436.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i=1}^{216}x_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"46\" height=\"55\" /> yields\n\\begin{gather*}\n\\sum_{i=1}^{216}x_{i}^{2}+2\\sum_{1\\le i &lt; j\\le 216}x_{i}x_{j}=1\\\\\n\\frac{214}{215}+\\sum_{i=1}^{216}\\frac{x_{i}^{2}}{1-a_{i}}=1\\\\\n\\frac{4}{3}x_{2}^{2}=\\frac{1}{215}-\\sum_{i\\neq 2}\\frac{x_{i}^2}{1-a_{i}}\n\\end{gather*}\nBy the Cauchy-Schwarz Inequality,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/b/b9b36d171cf5d2b76060a1ebc859e10c64da1f26.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\sum_{i\\neq 2}\\frac{x_{i}^2}{1-a_{i}})(\\sum_{i\\neq 2}1-a_{i})\\ge (\\sum_{i\\neq 2}x_{i})^2\\]\" width=\"270\" height=\"50\" />\nThe maximal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/8/5e8655384b71dbea96222803bcc8bdfa98299216.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> occurs as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/0/1b028bc20330ee95e00d1ddd5988f9a1307ce900.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i\\neq 2}\\frac{x_{i}^2}{1-a_{i}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -26px\" width=\"81\" height=\"53\" />, on the RHS, is minimized. We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/d/b1d50fe7027cd51f5eb6c963893087d1fa868221.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i\\neq 2}1-a_{i}=\\frac{857}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -26px\" width=\"132\" height=\"51\" />. Thus,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/e/3ceac3ad926b4f6cf12fcadace0ff951160e4e81.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{4}{3}x_{2}^{2}=\\frac{1}{215}-\\frac{4(1-x_{2})^2}{857}\\]\" width=\"189\" height=\"39\" />\nSolving yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/e/1fea4874336ff85a515c332e097ba63f5ded87a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{2}=\\frac{3}{860}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"38\" />, and the requested sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/f/26f9b9b52a0d35c7259acb79422710b677b5bfcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+860=\\boxed{863}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"123\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~Pieandpi31415926535897932\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mjtM-Coav4k\">https://youtu.be/mjtM-Coav4k</a>\n</p><p>~MathProblemSolvingSkills.com\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II\" title=\"2016 AIME II\">2016 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2016\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2016 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\